<p>Reviko users may request deletion of their account and associated personal information, subject to legal and operational retention requirements.</p>

  <p class="legal-mail-cta">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:privacy@reviko.io">
      <span>Request deletion via privacy@reviko.io</span>
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M5 12h14" />
        <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
      </svg>
    </a>
  </p>

  <h2>How to Request Deletion</h2>
  <p>You may submit a deletion request by:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>using the account deletion option available inside Reviko, when available; or</li>
    <li>emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@reviko.io">privacy@reviko.io</a> from the email address associated with your account.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Include enough information for us to reasonably identify the account.</p>

  <h2>What Happens Next</h2>
  <p>Reviko may verify your identity before completing the request.</p>
  <p>After verification, Reviko will delete or de-identify personal information that is no longer reasonably necessary, subject to information that must be retained for legal, accounting, security, fraud prevention, dispute resolution, or other lawful purposes.</p>

  <h2>Merchant Accounts</h2>
  <p>Deleting a Merchant account may affect active loyalty programs and customer passes. Outstanding Merchant obligations to Customers are not automatically eliminated by deletion of the Reviko account.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy requests: <a href="mailto:privacy@reviko.io">privacy@reviko.io</a></p>
